+/// Independent evidence required only when low contrast makes every native rival cheaper than 14.
+/// Feature support must be distinctive and spread out (the hypothesis confidence includes spatial spread),
+/// and the held-out audit must pass its strict GLOBAL branch. A local unchanged island in an otherwise
+/// changing page is not enough. Do not add a second threshold on the fraction of agreeing blocks: the global
+/// error/mismatch already measures that evidence, and soft map labels can cross many block boundaries.
+fn independent_translation(m: &Motion, a: &Audit) -> bool {
+    m.unique >= 12
+        && m.unique * 2 >= m.support
+        && !m.ambiguous
+        && m.confidence >= 0.7
+        && a.error < TRACKED_ERROR
+        && a.mismatch < 0.2
+        && a.agreeing >= 4
+        && a.overlap >= 0.25
 }
 
